4,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! I'm so excited to be part of this. Let's make sure we don't just pick the flashiest plan, but one that actually works. I'll start by looking into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent start, May. A blueprint is merely a wish until it is tested against reality. I shall examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I am very happy to be here with you all. I hope we can work together harmoniously. I would like to look into the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can find a path that brings comfort to all our commuters. I shall look into the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe it is wise to look beyond the immediate totals to understand our long-term commitments. I shall examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,It seems we've covered all the bases! I love how we're diving into everything from the money to the actual commute. I'm curious to see if the past holds any secrets for us.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
11,1,2,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, May. The archives are often the only place where the optimistic promises of the past meet the stubborn reality of the present. I shall await the revelations of the records with a measured curiosity.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
13,1,2,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. It is wonderful that we are all taking such a thorough approach. I hope the data helps us find a solution that truly supports the passengers' needs. I am looking forward to seeing what we discover.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
15,1,2,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
16,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is so lovely to see everyone's enthusiasm. I believe that by listening to the stories hidden in these records, we can make a choice that is kind to both the workers and the travelers.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
17,1,2,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
18,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. There is a quiet truth in the numbers that often goes unspoken. I look forward to seeing how our findings align to guide us toward a sustainable path.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
19,1,2,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
